[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892111\">7015A04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Move the lock over slightly.</p><p>3. Disconnect the linkage.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035623.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2892122\">7015B34</a></p>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p><a href=\"#/2892122\">7015B34</a></p><p>Connect the linkage.</p><p>Fit the lock and tighten its bolts.</p><p>Check that the barrel and the lock control\nmechanism are working properly.</p>"]]